'''Never Summer!''' (だって夏じゃニャーイ！, ''Datte Natsu Janyāi!'', '''Cause it's Nyat Summer!''') is the July event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.3 Update|Version 2.3]].

==Event==
Even the most dedicated lady needs a holiday sometimes! Too bad for Vacation Queen that the beach is a prime spot for haters of all kinds!<br>
Visit the Legend Stages to challenge the limited monthly stage "Never Summer"! Help the Cats rid themselves of beachside bullies like Bearkini and Sunny Celeboodle and you might unlock a special reward!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''This event starts the 1st of July and continues until the 1st of August.'''}}

Get a chance to unlock Vacation Queen upon clearing any event stage! Your chances will increase greatly if you play later, more difficult stages! (Or get a 100% chance to collect rewards by using the Treasure Radar item!)

※ After you have picked up Vacation Queen, unlock it at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu. If you have collected Vacation Queen from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.
※If stages for this event do not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version and restart the app.

