==Trivia==
*Never Summer!'s Japanese name, Datte Natsu Janyāi!, is a reference to the 1993 hit single "[https://youtu.be/ZA86CE_te-M Datte Natsu Janai!]" by [[wikipedia:Tube (band)|Tube]].
*Each Never Summer! stage's Japanese name is a reference to a different song:
**[[Glutton Next Door|Stage 1]]: Taiyō no Komachi Angel = "[https://youtu.be/_46q__aRHAA Taiyō no Komachi Angel]" by [[wikipedia:B'z|B'z]]
**[[Summer Already?|Stage 2]]: Mo Natsuyasumi = "[https://youtu.be/fRm-oTQOM_w Ah, Natsuyasumi]" by Tube
**[[Something About Cats|Stage 3]]: Neko ni Matsuwaru Et Cetera = "[https://youtu.be/tht0SnekaLM Nagisa ni Matsuwaru Et Cetera]" by [[wikipedia:PuffyAyumi|PuffyAyumi]]
**[[Summertime Smoothie|Stage 4]]: Manatsu no Kajū = "[https://youtu.be/8mYSLRDeQfg Manatsu no Kajitsu]" by [[wikipedia:Southern All-Stars|Southern All-Stars]]
**[[Starving in Summer|Stage 5]]: Nani mo Kuenakute･･･Natsu = "[https://youtu.be/k3qW0Jv-9sg Nani mo Ienakute･･･Natsu]" by [[wikipedia:ja:THE JAYWALK|THE JAYWALK]]
**[[Boy Meats Girl|Stage 6]]: BOY MEATS GIRL = "[https://youtu.be/qpSOuJ9t_Yo BOY MEETS GIRL]" by [[wikipedia:TRF (group)|TRF]]
**[[Sandbags on the Cape|Stage 7]]: Nagisa no Sandbag = "[https://youtu.be/pnCc3fp2ZC0 Nagisa no Sindbad]" by [[wikipedia:Pink Lady (duo)|Pink Lady]]
**[[Right here, right meow|Stage 8]]: Season in the Nyan = "[https://youtu.be/4Y9OmCUsUBk Season in the Sun]" by Tube
***Stage 1 is the only one to share a name with its reference rather than being a pun.
***Stage 6 is still called Boy Meats Girl in [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]], making it the only stage whose reference wasn't lost in translation.
***Tube is the only musical act to get more than one reference in this event.
***"Nagisa no Sindbad" and "Season in the Sun" are the only songs referenced not to come from the 1990s: the former is from the 70s, the latter the 80s.
***It is one of the three events to have such a naming scheme, the others being [[Never Not Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Not Summer!]] and [[Cats in the Snow]].

